809875075d04b91","fixture":true}],"checks":["Without a wallet public figures show, wallet figures are absent and actions are disabled.","Earn layout: the Pool selector shows one mounted card at a time and keeps the other card's typed amounts and reads; the hidden pool and the hidden panels take no focus by Tab or by script; every tab works by click and keyboard with one panel showing; fourteen and eight figure hooks once each, the personal summary above the tabs and every other figure visible on its own tab only; the Details and withdraw disclosures open and close.","Typing: every amount box of the three cards takes digits and a decimal point key by key, Backspace and Delete in the middle, Home and End, select-all and retype, and an inserted paste; after each of 216 keystrokes the box, the matched figures and the reason line equal a plain text box's.","Wrong-chain warning disables ITEM actions without changing public figures.","1/17 bask Approve: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","2/17 bask Stake: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","3/17 bask Withdraw: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","4/17 bask Claim ITEM: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","5/17 eth Approve: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","6/17 eth Stake: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","7/17 eth Withdraw: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","8/17 eth Claim ITEM: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","All reward figures match chain rates, stakes and BASK pot before a fee arrives.","All reward figures match chain rates, stakes and BASK pot after a fee arrives.","9/17 staking Approve: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","10/17 staking Stake: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","A BASK stream started before the fee arrived (one wei and a public sync, with 10000000000000000000000 ITEM staked at the time) finishes on the fork before the walk's fee streams; after an hour behind it the site showed 0 BASK earned, and it shows the earnings once they flow.","All reward figures match chain rates, stakes and BASK pot with one ITEM staker and accrued fees.","Earn dollar estimate matches independent BASK times vault NAV divided by supply, with the last-read valuation explanation.","ITEM staking shows BASK rewards and their USD estimate only; optional-token sections, claims and Earn reward reads are absent.","11/17 staking Unstake: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","12/17 staking Claim BASK: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","The original 12 UI sends retain their order; BASK staking rewards stream over time and the BASK claim pays only BASK.","Partial read: with the USDG router allowance unreadable, only the BASK/USDG Add liquidity action is off, with its reason; every figure of the three cards still agrees with the chain and Withdraw and Unstake stay available; a refresh restores the form.","13/17 bask Approve BASK: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","14/17 bask Approve USDG: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","Disconnect during the fresh liquidity read cancels before wallet preflight or any prompt; deliberate reconnect can add normally.","15/17 bask Add liquidity: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","bask add: actual router mint, both reserve increases, both wallet debits and immediate staking balance agree.","16/17 eth Approve ITEM: exact calldata and chain/DOM agreement","eth add: a pool that moved after the quote is refused at the press with no wallet prompt, and the form shows the moved pool's figures before the next press.","17/17 eth Add liquidity: exact calldata and ETH value and chain/DOM agreement","eth add: actual router mint, both reserve increases, both wallet debits and immediate staking balance agree.","Exactly 17 UI sends in the specified order; only the ITEM/ETH add carries ETH value.","All reward figures match chain rates, stakes and BASK pot after a second staker is funded and stakes in each pool.","Transparency shows contracts, exact source and developer/live vault roles, preserves unavailable roles honestly, and adds no ITEM reads.","Docs Find ITEM and the existing Tokenomics live block are reachable when filled.","Vault, Deposit, Redeem, Owner, Losses and Transparency make no ITEM reads while Earn is closed.","New page content fits 320, 375, 1440 and 1920; every action can be scrolled into view. Header visibility is checked separately.","Pending-send lock: a saved ITEM send of another account without a receipt turns every ITEM action off with the pending reason on load and after Refresh; a vault send's write and clear under the vault's key leaves the ITEM record and the lock in place; with the passed nonce in the record the page loaded, the lock holds on load and after Refresh while a transaction is queued, settles once nothing is, and the record is removed; a record without a nonce stays locked until it is removed.","An ITEM send confirmed after Earn was left and opened again: the reopened page shows the figures after the receipt and its actions are available, without Refresh; no record stays saved.","An ITEM send confirmed after the wallet switched to another account: the shown account's cards and figures stay without Refresh; the earlier account's refresh reads the shown account's figures again.","The lock that the account change's check turned on while the send was unmined clears with the send's own receipt: the actions are available again without Refresh and no record stays saved.","An older lock check whose reads fail only after a newer check found the receipt and removed the record leaves the lock off.","Lookup error is not \"not found\": with the transaction lookup, then the receipt lookup, failing on both RPC hosts for a saved record whose nonce has passed with nothing queued, every ITEM action stays off with the pending reason on load and after Refresh, no other error shows, the record stays, and it settles once the lookups answer again."],"states":[{"name":"No wallet","fixture":false,"detail":"","screenshot":"item-states-1.jpg","cell":1},